This directory is the BeingDB compile root: `beingdb-compile --git <git_store> --pack <pack_store>`
reads predicate facts from here (one file per predicate, e.g. `created_by.pl`),
after `beingdb-clone`-ing this repository into `<git_store>`.

Files here are generated by `npm run extract` (see src/serialize.ts) and merged
across all configured interviews, so cross-artist joins share atom IDs. Do not
hand-edit generated lines - regenerate and review the Git diff instead.

This directory is intentionally empty until you run the pipeline (see the
top-level README's "How to regenerate facts" section) with a valid
OPENAI_API_KEY.
